OL,3,AI won't let my daughter's killer live
OL,4,Ain my head, says Sarah Payne's mother
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of murdered schoolgirl Sarah
OL,7,FPayne says she wants to change how
OL,8,Fpeople see victims of crime.
OL,10,FSara Payne's daughter was abducted
OL,11,Fwhile playing with her siblings and
OL,12,Fmurdered in July 2000, aged just eight.
OL,14,FRoy Whiting - a convicted sex offender
OL,15,F- was jailed for life in December 2001
OL,16,Ffor her killing.
OL,18,FSara told BBC South East there were
OL,19,Fmany reasons behind how people behaved,
OL,20,Fbut they "still have choices".
